{"slug":"b-y-n","ar":"ب ي ن","total":523,"core":"clarity; between","forms":[{"ar":"بَيْن","kind":"place","form":null,"count":266,"gloss":"Between, among","word":"bayna","ex":{"s":55,"a":20,"p":1,"ar":["بَيْنَهُمَا","بَرْزَخٌ","لَّا","يَبْغِيَانِ"],"en":"Between them is a barrier [so] neither of them transgresses"}},{"ar":"مُّبِين","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":119,"gloss":"clear, manifest","word":null,"ex":{"s":43,"a":2,"p":2,"ar":["وَٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","ٱلْمُبِينِ"],"en":"By the clear Book"}},{"ar":"بَيِّنَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":71,"gloss":"clear proof","word":null,"ex":{"s":29,"a":35,"p":5,"ar":["وَلَقَد","تَّرَكْنَا","مِنْهَآ","ءَايَةًۢ","بَيِّنَةً","لِّقَوْمٍ","يَعْقِلُونَ"],"en":"And We have certainly left of it a sign as clear evidence for a people who use reason"}},{"ar":"بَيَّنُ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":35,"gloss":"to make clear","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":242,"p":2,"ar":["كَذَٰلِكَ","يُبَيِّنُ","ٱللَّهُ","لَكُمْ","ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَعْقِلُونَ"],"en":"Thus does Allah make clear to you His verses that you might use reason"}},{"ar":"تَبَيَّنَ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":18,"gloss":"to become clear; to verify","word":null,"ex":{"s":8,"a":6,"p":5,"ar":["يُجَٰدِلُونَكَ","فِى","ٱلْحَقِّ","بَعْدَمَا","تَبَيَّنَ","كَأَنَّمَا","يُسَاقُونَ","إِلَى","ٱلْمَوْتِ","وَهُمْ","يَنظُرُونَ"],"en":"Arguing with you concerning the truth after it had become clear, as if they were being driven toward death while they were looking on"}},{"ar":"بَيَان","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"eloquent speech, explanation","word":null,"ex":{"s":55,"a":4,"p":2,"ar":["عَلَّمَهُ","ٱلْبَيَانَ"],"en":"[And] taught him eloquence"}},{"ar":"مُّبَيِّنَٰت","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"clear, clarifying","word":null,"ex":{"s":24,"a":46,"p":4,"ar":["لَّقَدْ","أَنزَلْنَآ","ءَايَـٰتٍ","مُّبَيِّنَـٰتٍ ۚ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَهْدِى","مَن","يَشَآءُ","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطٍ","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ"],"en":"We have certainly sent down distinct verses. And Allah guides whom He wills to a straight path"}},{"ar":"مُّبَيِّنَة","kind":"active participle","form":2,"count":3,"gloss":"manifest, flagrant","word":null,"ex":{"s":33,"a":30,"p":7,"ar":["يَـٰنِسَآءَ","ٱلنَّبِىِّ","مَن","يَأْتِ","مِنكُنَّ","بِفَـٰحِشَةٍ","مُّبَيِّنَةٍ","يُضَـٰعَفْ","لَهَا","ٱلْعَذَابُ","ضِعْفَيْنِ ۚ","وَكَانَ","ذَٰلِكَ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","يَسِيرًا"],"en":"O wives of the Prophet, whoever of you should commit a clear immorality - for her the punishment would be doubled two fold, and ever is that, for Allah, easy"}},{"ar":"بَيِّن","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"clear","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":15,"p":11,"ar":["هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","قَوْمُنَا","ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","مِن","دُونِهِۦٓ","ءَالِهَةً ۖ","لَّوْلَا","يَأْتُونَ","عَلَيْهِم","بِسُلْطَـٰنٍۭ","بَيِّنٍ ۖ","فَمَنْ","أَظْلَمُ","مِمَّنِ","ٱفْتَرَىٰ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","كَذِبًا"],"en":"These, our people, have taken besides Him deities. Why do they not bring for [worship of] them a clear authority? And who is more unjust than one who invents about Allah a lie"}},{"ar":"مُسْتَبِين","kind":"active participle","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"clear, explicit","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":117,"p":3,"ar":["وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمَا","ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","ٱلْمُسْتَبِينَ"],"en":"And We gave them the explicit Scripture"}},{"ar":"تَسْتَبِينَ","kind":"verb","form":10,"count":1,"gloss":"to become manifest","word":null,"ex":{"s":6,"a":55,"p":4,"ar":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نُفَصِّلُ","ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","وَلِتَسْتَبِينَ","سَبِيلُ","ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ"],"en":"And thus do We detail the verses, and [thus] the way of the criminals will become evident"}},{"ar":"تِبْيَٰن","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"clarification, exposition","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":89,"p":18,"ar":["وَيَوْمَ","نَبْعَثُ","فِى","كُلِّ","أُمَّةٍ","شَهِيدًا","عَلَيْهِم","مِّنْ","أَنفُسِهِمْ ۖ","وَجِئْنَا","بِكَ","شَهِيدًا","عَلَىٰ","هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ ۚ","وَنَزَّلْنَا","عَلَيْكَ","ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","تِبْيَـٰنًا","لِّكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","وَهُدًى","وَرَحْمَةً","وَبُشْرَىٰ","لِلْمُسْلِمِينَ"],"en":"And [mention] the Day when We will resurrect among every nation a witness over them from themselves. And We will bring you, [O Muhammad], as a witness over your nation. And We have sent down to you the Book as clarification for all things and as guidance and mercy and good tidings for the Muslims"}},{"ar":"يُبِينُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"to speak clearly","word":null,"ex":{"s":43,"a":52,"p":11,"ar":["أَمْ","أَنَا۠","خَيْرٌ","مِّنْ","هَـٰذَا","ٱلَّذِى","هُوَ","مَهِينٌ","وَلَا","يَكَادُ","يُبِينُ"],"en":"Or am I [not] better than this one who is insignificant and hardly makes himself clear"}}],"surahs":[[2,46],[4,37],[5,24],[3,22],[6,16],[34,16],[7,15],[10,15],[16,14],[18,14],[24,14],[43,14],[11,11],[8,10],[26,10],[20,9],[22,9],[27,9],[29,9],[36,9],[41,9],[46,9],[17,8],[37,8],[40,8],[42,8],[12,7],[28,7],[38,7],[44,7],[60,7],[9,6],[19,6],[25,6],[39,6],[57,6],[15,5],[45,5],[49,5],[14,4],[21,4],[30,4],[55,4],[65,4],[13,3],[23,3],[33,3],[35,3],[47,3],[51,3],[58,3],[61,3],[32,2],[48,2],[54,2],[59,2],[64,2],[67,2],[98,2],[31,1],[50,1],[52,1],[56,1],[62,1],[66,1],[71,1],[72,1],[75,1],[78,1],[81,1],[86,1]]}